view|tv1b|tv1b|0|CREATE VIEW tv1b AS SELECT x.id, tx.id FROM x JOIN tempx tx on tx.id=x.id
view|tv2|tv2|0|CREATE VIEW tv2 AS SELECT * FROM tv1 UNION SELECT * FROM tv1b
table|x|x|2|CREATE TABLE x(id integer primary key, a TEXT NULL)
